<title>SWEDEN: Average rate 4.15 pct on Swedish 3-month T-bill.</title>
<headline>Average rate 4.15 pct on Swedish 3-month T-bill.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted rates in an auction of three-month and six-month Treasury bills were 4.15 percent and 4.30 percent, respectively, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The office had invited bids for a total of 4.5 billion crowns of three-month and six-month paper. It received bids for 7.9 billion crowns, and allocated 4.5 billion.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1003</p>
